#: ../../tutorials/custom_components.md:7
msgid "Add a custom component to an existing contract"
msgstr "既存の契約に独自Componentを追加する"

#: ../../tutorials/custom_components.md:9
msgid ""
"This page assumes that you are implementing a replacement that fits an "
"existing component contract."
msgstr "前提は、既存のComponentの契約に収まる差し替えを実装することです。"

#: ../../tutorials/custom_components.md:10
msgid "What you'll be able to do"
msgstr "このページでできるようになること"

#: ../../tutorials/custom_components.md:13
msgid ""
"By the end of this page, you'll be able to choose an extension point, "
"verify its minimal contract, register the component, and test it."
msgstr "このページを終えると、拡張点を選び、最小の契約を確認し、登録してテストできます。"

#: ../../tutorials/custom_components.md:16
msgid ""
"See [Extension guidelines](../concepts/extension_guidelines.md) for the "
"extension-point categories. If you need to change a contract or the "
"execution framework itself, continue to [Framework "
"extensions](../framework/extensions.md)."
msgstr "[拡張ガイドライン](../concepts/extension_guidelines.md)で拡張点の分類を確認します。契約や実行フレームワーク自体を変更する場合は、[フレームワーク拡張](../framework/extensions.md)へ進みます。"

#: ../../tutorials/custom_components.md:18
msgid "The import policy is collected in [Canonical Imports](../api/imports.md)."
msgstr "importの方針は [Canonical Imports](../api/imports.md) にまとめています。"

#: ../../tutorials/custom_components.md:20
msgid "Choose an extension point"
msgstr "拡張点を選ぶ"

#: ../../tutorials/custom_components.md:22
msgid ""
"If changing a built-in component's settings is enough, use [Swapping "
"built-in components](component_swap.md) or [Hooks](interface_hooks.md). "
"When you need new search, prediction, evaluation, or generation logic, "
"choose the component with the corresponding contract."
msgstr "ビルトインコンポーネントの設定変更で足りるなら、[ビルトインコンポーネントの差し替え](component_swap.md)または[Hook](interface_hooks.md)を使います。新しい探索、予測、評価、生成ロジックが必要な場合は、対応する契約を持つコンポーネントを選びます。"

